description=Diagnostic-only companion for Project Viewpoint. Detects Viewpoint, ZombieBuddy and the game version, logs [VPGeometryFix] lines and, in debug mode, dumps read-only information about the tile/object you target. Does NOT change rendering, gameplay, save games or any game/Viewpoint file. Keys (rebindable in Options > Key Bindings > [VPGeometryFix]): Home debug, End inspect, PageUp hover, PageDown Viewpoint class inventory.
